# 6. JetBrains Rider
# ---------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
*.sln.iml
*.DotSettings.user
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
.idea_modules/
# Shared run configurations are kept in .run/ and committed.
# Shared code style lives in .editorconfig and <Solution>.sln.DotSettings (committed).

